{%- comment -%}
  MANAGER FEEDBACK SPRINT (Perú vs España parity, annotated review PDF) —
  fixes items A (range title alignment) and part of B (title size) for the
  "range title" heading that opens every range page ("Hop", "Ultra Repair",
  "Colour Last", "Smooth Hydration", "Under", "luxlight").

  Contains no markup: scopes styling only, by section id, to the intro
  section's own H1 on each of the 6 range pages. All six intro sections
  share the exact same underlying structure — Horizon's native `section`
  type with `section_width: page-width`, wrapping a `group` block whose
  heading uses `type_preset: h1` — confirmed by inspecting all 6 templates
  before writing this rule, so one shared selector list is correct instead
  of six near-duplicate one-off overrides.

  Values measured live against the actual official Spain reference today
  (hair.montibello.com/gama/hop/, /gama/under/), not guessed:
    - H1 font-size: 40px @ desktop (≥750px), 35px @ mobile
    - H1 left edge is flush with the left edge of the range's first
      contained editorial image (measured at 95px @ 1440px viewport, 20px
      @ 390px), NOT with Horizon's page-width container gutter that the
      native `section` type used here defaults to (measured 40px @ 1440px,
      16px @ 390px on Peru) — hence the padding-inline-start compensation
      below, computed as the exact measured difference (95-40=55px desktop,
      20-16=4px mobile), not an arbitrary value.

  Peru's current H1 sizes measured today: 56px @ desktop / 48px @ mobile on
  every one of these 6 pages (all six use the identical native `section` +
  `group` + `text` block pattern, so they'd inherited the same oversized
  default) — confirms the manager's "TITULO MAS PEQUEÑO" note was accurate,
  not a false read.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  :is(
    [id$='__intro_hop'],
    [id$='__intro_ultra_repair'],
    [id$='__intro_colour_last'],
    [id$='__intro_smooth_hydration'],
    [id$='__hero_intro_under'],
    [id$='__intro_luxlight']
  ) h1 {
    font-size: 35px !important;
    line-height: 35px !important;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    padding-inline-start: 0;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      font-size: 40px !important;
      line-height: 40px !important;
      padding-inline-start: 0;
    }
  }

  /* FULL-SITE PARITY (official /gama/hop/, 1440): the range title sits on the
     same 1300px container edge as the editorial rows below (not Horizon's
     40px page gutter), the intro copy starts at the second 650px column plus
     its 20px inner padding, and the band shares the beige of the rows. */
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    :is(
      [id$='__intro_hop'],
      [id$='__intro_ultra_repair'],
      [id$='__intro_colour_last'],
      [id$='__intro_smooth_hydration'],
      [id$='__hero_intro_under'],
      [id$='__intro_luxlight']
    ) {
      background-color: rgb(246, 246, 243);

      .custom-section-content {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1300px;
        margin-inline: auto;
      }

      .custom-section-content > div {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .custom-section-content .group-block {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .group-block-content {
        padding-inline: 0 !important;
        justify-content: flex-start !important;
        align-items: flex-start !important;
        text-align: left;
      }

      .group-block-content .text-block {
        justify-content: flex-start !important;
        align-items: flex-start !important;
      }

      .custom-section-content p {
        font-size: 16px !important;
        line-height: 19.7px !important;
        font-weight: 500 !important;
        color: #000;
        max-width: 600px;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #000;
      }

      a.button,
      .button {
        height: 36px;
        padding: 0 20px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
    }

    /* /gama/hop/ lays the title and the intro copy side by side in two
       650px columns (copy inset 20px); the family pages stack them. */
    [id$='__intro_hop'] .group-block-content {
      gap: 0 !important;
    }

    [id$='__intro_hop'] .group-block-content > .group-block {
      width: 50% !important;
      flex: 0 0 50%;
    }

    [id$='__intro_hop'] .group-block-content > .group-block:nth-child(2) {
      padding-inline-start: 20px;
    }

    :is(
      [id$='__intro_ultra_repair'],
      [id$='__intro_colour_last'],
      [id$='__intro_smooth_hydration'],
      [id$='__hero_intro_under'],
      [id$='__intro_luxlight']
    ) .group-block-content {
      gap: 10px !important;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    :is(
      [id$='__intro_hop'],
      [id$='__intro_ultra_repair'],
      [id$='__intro_colour_last'],
      [id$='__intro_smooth_hydration'],
      [id$='__hero_intro_under'],
      [id$='__intro_luxlight']
    ) {
      background-color: rgb(246, 246, 243);

      p {
        font-size: 16px !important;
        line-height: 19.7px !important;
        font-weight: 500 !important;
        color: #000;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #000;
      }
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

